+   Section ("Every small sorted input vs own nested-loop join (agent A3)");
+   -------------------------------------------------------------------------
+   --  Reference written for this test: for each left row in order, for
+   --  each right row in order, emit the pair when the keys are equal.
+   --  All nondecreasing key lists of length 0 .. 4 over keys 1 .. 3 on
+   --  both sides (35 x 35 pairs of inputs); payloads are the positions.
